{"sourceUrl":"http://sociology.zju.edu.cn/index.php/News/details.html?id=866&tid=17&sid=2","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:37.137518+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://sociology.zju.edu.cn/index.php/News/details.html?id=866&tid=17&sid=2","html":"<div>\n<p><span><span>社会学系</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span><span>年拟接收</span></span><span>推荐免试研究生，欢迎本校及外校的优秀应届本科生</span><span>报名</span><span>申请</span><span><span>。硕士专业</span><span>/</span><span>方向为社会学、人口学和社会工作，直博专业为社会学、人口学。</span></span></p><p><span>1. </span><span>申请条件、报名方式等详见</span><a href=\"http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/2025/0728/c28479a3071793/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>《浙江大学关于<span>2026</span>年接收外校推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知》</span></a><span><span>（报名系统学院请选择“公共管理学院”）</span>。</span></p><p><span>2. </span><strong><span>报名</span></strong><strong><span>截止时间为</span></strong><strong><span><span>2025</span><span>年</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>9</span><span><font>月</font><font>10</font></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span><span>24</span><span>时。本校及外校报名方式和截止时间均一致</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>3. </span><span>申请材料</span></p><p><span>（1）</span><span>有</span><span>效身份证扫描件</span><span>；</span><span>本科期间成绩单（</span><span>所在学校</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>院系</span><span>盖章）</span><span>；</span><span>外语水平证明</span><span>；</span><span>专业排名证明（</span><span>所在学校</span><span><span>/</span></span><span>院系</span><span>盖章）</span><span>；</span><span>如果有已发表的学术论文等科研成果，或有科技活动获奖的，请提交证明材料。</span></p><p><span>（2）</span><strong><span>直博申请人</span></strong><span><span>外语水平原则上需符合以下任意一项（</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日至申请截止日期间的成绩方为有效）：大学英语六级</span><span>500</span><span>及以上，或</span><span>WSK(PETS 5)</span><span>合格，或英语专业八级合格，或雅思</span><span>6.0</span><span>及以上，或托福</span><span>85</span><span>及以上。</span></span></p><p><span>（3）</span><strong><span>直博申请人</span></strong><span>须</span><span>提供两位报考学科专业领域内</span><span>副</span><span>教授（或相当专业职称的专家）</span><span>的</span><span>专家推荐书（</span><font><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/5f07d39f9b5684e4021d.gif\"/></span></font><a href=\"http://sociology.zju.edu.cn/ueditor/php/upload/file/20250730/1753858869423303.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"专家推荐书.docx\">专家推荐书.docx</a><span>），由专家本人发送有签名的<span>PDF</span>文件至邮箱<span>0918015@zju.edu.cn</span>，</span><strong><span>邮件和文件请命名为“博士专家推荐书<span>-</span></span></strong><strong><span>考生</span></strong><strong><span>姓名<span>-</span>推荐专家姓名”，截止时间与系统报名截止时间一致</span></strong><strong><span>（</span></strong><strong><span><span>2025</span>年</span></strong><strong><span><span>9</span>月</span><span><font>10</font></span></strong><strong><span>日<span>24</span>时</span></strong><strong><span>）</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>4. </span><span>联系</span><span>邮箱：</span><a href=\"mailto:0918015@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>0918015@zju.edu.cn</span></span></a><span>。</span></p><p><span>后续安排请关注社会学系相关通知。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>浙江大学社会学系</span></p><p><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>30</span></span><span>日</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><br/></p> </div>","textSha256":"470ced067fc051999a9541f3bf73be5bcadf7c1fb8a7f08feadc3f85709bb2d9","textLength":600,"sourceSha256":"e227198c19f758cd15024e412a2934984c3453d7365092d5fded809cf4ce1bc8","selector":".detail_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-6888e09eccc4979bf2a8","title":"2025年浙江大学社会学系关于2026年接收推荐免试研究生报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:37.137518+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://sociology.zju.edu.cn/Public/Resources/js/lib/ueditor/1.4.3/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/5f07d39f9b5684e4021d.gif"}]}
